SPRINT 3 — DREAM ACTIVATION / DREAM ANCHOR
==========================================
STATUS: NEXT

Goal
----
Replace the temporary global activation boolean with an intentional,
in-world mechanism that allows individual beds/players to opt into
Dream gameplay without replacing normal Minecraft sleeping.


Proposed Behavior
-----------------

NO DREAM ANCHOR

Player uses bed
↓
Vanilla sleeping behavior
↓
Dream mod does nothing


VALID DREAM ANCHOR

Player uses bed
↓
Vanilla validates sleep normally
↓
If sleep is invalid:
    Dream does not start

If sleep is valid:
    Dream Anchor condition succeeds
    ↓
    Player transitions into Dream
    ↓
    Existing DreamService lifecycle handles everything else


